    -c, --until-contains <until_contains>    Keep going until the output contains this string\n\
    -r, --until-error <until_error>          Keep going until the command exit status is the value given\n\
    -m, --until-match <until_match>          Keep going until the output matches this regular expression\n\
    -t, --until-time <until_time>            Keep going until a future time, ex. \"2018-04-20 04:20:00\" (Times in UTC.)\n\
\n\
ARGS:\n\
    <input>...    The command to be looped\n",
        bin
